                <pb facs="0424" n="342" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg342"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 882.51/52.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-06-21"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June 21,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Cables under date of 11th and 18th received. Government of Liberia officially
                    informed the appointment of Falkner. Instructions <pb facs="0425" n="343"
                        xml:id="pg343"/> to American bankers cabled to-day. Commission by mail as
                    advised in cable. Full information by cable after a meeting of the Cabinet.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lyon.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
